(Transliteration:) Tj
0 -12 Td
('Allahumma irhamna bil-Qur'an, waj'alhu lana imaman wa nuran wa hudan wa rahmah.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(Allahumma dhakkirna minhu ma nussina, wa 'allimna minhu ma jahilna,) Tj
0 -12 Td
(warzuqna tilawatahu ana'a al-layli wa atraf an-nahar,) Tj
0 -12 Td
(waj'alhu lana hujjatan ya Rabbal 'Alameen.') Tj
0 -12 Td
