0 -12 Td
(English Translation:) Tj
0 -12 Td
('O Allah, have mercy upon us through the Holy Quran, and make it for us a leader,) Tj
0 -12 Td
(a light, a guidance, and a mercy. O Allah, remind us from it what we have forgotten,) Tj
0 -12 Td
(teach us from it that which we do not know, and grant us its recitation throughout) Tj
0 -12 Td
(the hours of the night and at the ends of the day, and make it an argument in our) Tj
0 -12 Td
(favor, O Lord of the Worlds.') Tj
